<title>HUNGARY: Budapest bourse suspends trade in Csopak.</title>
<headline>Budapest bourse suspends trade in Csopak.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Budapest Stock Exchange (BSE) said on Tuesday it had suspended trading in the shares of Csopak Szovetkezeti Rt for Tuesday following a newspaper report about a new Csopak acquisition the company has not yet reported to the bourse.</p>
<p>&quot;(The press report said) Csopak acquired a 98 percent stake in Pannonker Kereskedelmi es Ipari Rt indirectly, via Chance 96 Vagyonkezelo Kft, a unit in which Csopak holds a 49 percent share,&quot; the BSE said.</p>
</text>
